  "markscheme": {
    "html": "<p>C</p>\n<p>The empirical formula for the nuclear radius is R = <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R_{0}\"></span> * A^(1/3), where A is the mass number. For gold-197 (197/79 Au), the mass number A is 197. Therefore, the radius is R = <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R_{0}\"></span> * (197)^(1/3).</p>"
  },
  "paper": "paper_1a",
